    <region left="135" top="1116" width="601" height="68" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>If the average horizontal shear stress is less than the permissible values in Table 5.5 of the Code,<br />only norminallinks equivalent to 0.15% of the contact area need to be provided. It is to be noted that<br />the provisions of shear links is based on the larger of the requirements for vertical and horizontal<br />shear and not addition of the two values.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
