    <region left="0" top="1557" width="619" height="68" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Calculation of crack widths can follow the procedures in Part 2 clause 3.8, of the Code. The calculation<br />of crack widths for beams with concrete covers under normal exposure conditions may not be<br />necessary if the bar spacing rules in Part 1 clause 3.12.11 , are observed. The permissible crack<br />width is 0.3 mm for normal reinforced concrete section.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
