    <region left="0" top="4662" width="583" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Design the simply supported main precast beams which are to be cast in full section. The beams<br />are to be unpropped during installation. Due to ceiling height requirements, overall depth of the<br />beam should not exceed 700 mm.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="4725" width="331" height="32" border="true" color="#000000" fontSize="16">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">1- Calculate ultimate floor loading</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="4761" width="587" height="50" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">g.total</e>
          <e type="operand">g.finishes</e>
          <e type="operand">g.services</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operand">g.partition</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operand">g.topping75mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operand">g.HCslabjointedweight</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">kN</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
