    <region left="0" top="7182" width="581" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Using Figure 2.22 and following the flow direction in the chart (shown on the following page), the<br />depth of beam is about 825 mm at the intersection at point C. Including 75mm thick topping, the<br />overall beam depth is 900 mm which is a reasonable beam dimension.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
